---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ritualExperiences } from '../data/ritualExperiences';

const fireRitual = ritualExperiences.fire;
const imageBase = '/images/digital-rituals/step-into-the-fire';
---
<Base
  title={`${fireRitual.title} | Tarot Flower`}
  description="A guided fire ritual with candle ceremony, journaling, embodied movement, original music, sound bath meditation, and permanent access."
  image={fireRitual.image}
  showBanner={false}
  additionalSchema={{
    '@type': 'Product',
    '@id': 'https://tarotflower.com/step-into-your-fire/#product',
    name: fireRitual.title,
    description: 'A guided digital fire ritual for courage, confidence, and transformation.',
    image: `https://tarotflower.com${fireRitual.image}`,
    url: 'https://tarotflower.com/step-into-your-fire/',
    brand: { '@id': 'https://tarotflower.com/#organization' },
  }}
>
  <main class="digital-ritual-page digital-ritual-page--fire">
    <header class="fire-hero">
      <img src={fireRitual.image} width={fireRitual.width} height={fireRitual.height} alt={fireRitual.imageAlt} />
    </header>

    <section class="fire-product-title">
      <div class="digital-ritual-row">
        <p class="fire-product-identifier">{fireRitual.title.toUpperCase()}</p>
        <h1>Become the Warrior Goddess</h1>
        <p class="fire-product-subtitle">A ritual for courage &amp; confidence</p>
        <div class="fire-offer-icons" aria-label={`Included with ${fireRitual.title}`}>
          <figure>
            <img src={`${imageBase}/ritual-icon.png`} width="500" height="555" alt="Ornate gold clapperboard and flame icon" />
            <figcaption>RITUAL</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <span class="fire-offer-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          <figure>
            <img src={`${imageBase}/companion-guide-icon.png`} width="500" height="555" alt="Ornate gold open book and star icon" />
            <figcaption>COMPANION GUIDE</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <span class="fire-offer-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          <figure>
            <img src={`${imageBase}/circle-icon.png`} width="500" height="555" alt="Ornate gold women and crescent moon icon" />
            <figcaption>THE CIRCLE</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="fire-section fire-story-opening--centered">
      <div class="digital-ritual-row fire-centered-story">
        <div class="fire-prose fire-opening-copy">
          <p class="fire-lede fire-major-statement">Losing your fire doesn't have to be as dramatic as it was for me. But I know what it feels like when everything goes dark.</p>
          <p>I had all four of my children taken from me in Mexico. In the blink of an eye I had <strong class="fire-armed-guards">armed guards with machine guns at my door</strong>, a slander campaign across social media, betrayal from people I believed were my friends. <strong class="fire-threats">Stalking, identity theft, vandalism.</strong></p>
          <p class="fire-erasure">They tried to erase me.</p>
          <div class="fire-darkness-beat">
            <p>I was consumed by a deep emptiness, a heaviness, a darkness that I felt through my bones.</p>
            <p>I lost the will to create. My inspiration failed me, and a purposelessness consumed me.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <figure class="fire-kali-vision">
          <img src={`${imageBase}/goddess-kali-power-closeup.png`} width="1024" height="1024" alt="Close-up of Goddess Kali crowned in gold and flowers, holding sacred fire" />
        </figure>

        <div class="fire-prose fire-kali-turning-point">
          <h2>And then the Goddess Kali spoke to me: <span>“Rise up out of the ashes and embody your power!”</span></h2>
          <p class="fire-ritual-thread"><span>And I answered her call with</span><strong>THIS RITUAL.</strong></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="fire-section fire-section--ember fire-story-section">
      <div class="digital-ritual-row fire-centered-story fire-ember-story">
        <div class="fire-prose fire-prose--light fire-ember-copy">
          <h2 class="fire-major-statement">I was surviving, but I wanted to feel alive again.</h2>
          <p>In a fit of rage, I screamed at the sky:</p>
          <blockquote class="fire-sky-cry">Why have you taken everything from me that I love and care about?</blockquote>
          <p>I threw my tarot cards across the room and collapsed onto the floor in tears, sobbing.</p>
          <p class="fire-ember-discovery">And then I saw <strong class="fire-ember-beat">one tiny little flame in my wombspace, still glowing, even if just an ember.</strong></p>
        </div>

        <figure class="fire-dance-still">
          <img
            src={`${imageBase}/vanessa-dancing-regenerated.png`}
            width="1254"
            height="1254"
            alt="Vanessa dancing with flowing black fabric during her fire embodiment practice"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </figure>

        <div class="fire-prose fire-practice-transition">
          <h2><span>That was the power</span> <span>of the FIRE calling me</span></h2>
          <p>Now, it’s your turn to answer the call of FIRE.</p>
          <ul class="fire-principles">
            <li>Reactivate your soul’s light</li>
            <li>Connect to Goddess Power through the ancient 5 Elements</li>
            <li>Activate your divine feminine magic through embodiment and dance</li>
            <li>Become the Warrior Goddess you were always meant to be</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="fire-section fire-story-section fire-guardian-section">
      <div class="digital-ritual-row fire-editorial-grid fire-power-grid">
        <figure class="fire-oracle-feature">
          <img src={`${imageBase}/guardian-cinematic.png`} width="1536" height="1024" alt="The Guardian warrior goddess holding her sword amid flowing red hair, gold ornamentation, flowers, and fire" />
        </figure>
        <div class="fire-prose fire-power-questions">
          <h2 class="fire-major-statement">What if everything you've been carrying could become something powerful?</h2>
          <p>What if the things that have hurt you could become fuel for your creation?</p>
          <p>What if you could feel alive again?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="fire-section fire-question-section fire-ritual-climax-section fire-guided-ritual-section">
      <div class="digital-ritual-row fire-prose fire-guided-ritual">
        <p class="fire-guardian-answer">You can.</p>
        <h2>I will guide you through this sacred reignition of your power every step of the way.</h2>
        <p class="fire-guided-ritual-intro">In this <strong>one-hour guided video ritual</strong> we will:</p>
        <ol class="fire-ritual-stages">
          <li><span>Open the channel to your sacred becoming</span></li>
          <li><span>Transmute your darkness into light through ancient ritual practices</span></li>
          <li><span>Invoke your power into the world through sacred dance</span></li>
          <li><span>Surrender to Kali’s message through sacred sound channeling—a blessing for you.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="fire-journey-begins">THIS IS JUST THE BEGINNING OF YOUR JOURNEY…</p>
        <p class="fire-threshold-call">Step across the threshold with me.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="fire-section fire-closing">
      <div class="digital-ritual-row fire-closing-grid">
        <div class="fire-prose fire-closing-copy">
          <h2>Leave the Ashes Behind.<br />Rise Up and Shine.</h2>
          <p class="fire-closing-magic">Let’s make some magic together.</p>
          <p class="fire-format-clarification">One-hour guided video ritual · Yours to experience anytime</p>
          {fireRitual.purchasable ? (
            <>
              <p class="fire-price"><strong>{fireRitual.priceLabel}</strong><br />One-time purchase · Permanent access</p>
              <a class="digital-ritual-button" href={fireRitual.purchaseHref}>Begin the Ritual</a>
            </>
          ) : (
            <span class="digital-ritual-button digital-ritual-button--disabled" aria-disabled="true">Coming Soon</span>
          )}
        </div>
        <figure class="fire-closing-art">
          <img src={`${imageBase}/fire-goddess-risen.jpg`} width="1024" height="1024" alt="Luminous Fire Goddess holding flame, radiant and transformed" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="fire-section fire-testimonial-section">
      <div class="digital-ritual-row fire-testimonial">
        <blockquote>
          <p>“I never thought that a woman could change the way I feel in my body – mind – soul. Vanessa made me trust in my inner strength – made me get in touch with my inner goddess and grow in a way I never thought possible 🤍”</p>
          <footer>— <strong>Tara, Austria</strong></footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="fire-section fire-faq-section">
      <div class="digital-ritual-row fire-faq">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <dl class="fire-faq-list">
          <div class="fire-faq-item">
            <dt>Do I need any experience with ritual or tarot?</dt>
            <dd>No. You don’t need any experience with ritual or tarot, and you don’t need your own cards. I’ll explain everything and guide you through the ritual as we go. All you need is a quiet space, a few beautiful things that have meaning for you, and a candle or fireproof bowl for the burning ritual.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="fire-faq-item">
            <dt>Do I need to complete the ritual all at once?</dt>
            <dd>Yes. The ritual is designed to be completed in one continuous experience. You can absolutely pause within the ritual to reflect more deeply or spend longer journaling, but once we’ve created our sacred circle, stay within the space and complete the journey with me. Leaving the circle and returning later disrupts the flow of the ritual and the energy we’ve created together.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="fire-faq-item">
            <dt>What will I need for the ritual?</dt>
            <dd>Everything you’ll need is outlined in your companion guide, and there’s no need to buy anything fancy or special. Most of what we use will already be in your home—simple things like a candle and a fireproof container, with incense, Palo Santo, crystals, or other sacred objects if you have and love them. Most importantly, give yourself privacy, freedom from interruptions, and dedicated time to be fully present for the ritual.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="fire-faq-item">
            <dt>How long does the ritual take?</dt>
            <dd>The ritual itself is approximately 40 minutes. I recommend setting aside about an hour so you have plenty of time to gather your materials, read through your companion guide, move through the ritual without rushing, and leave space for reflection afterward.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="fire-faq-item">
            <dt>How do I access the ritual?</dt>
            <dd>After your purchase, you’ll be taken directly to your private Ritual Library, where you can begin the ritual immediately. Your access is permanent, so you can return whenever you want. If you’re using a new device or your session has expired, simply request a secure sign-in link using the same email address you used at checkout.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Base>
